  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance for the OACPS financial management reinforcement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The objective of this assignment is to support the OACPS Secretariat in enhancing its efficiency of reporting to the European Commission and in strengthening its budgeting, procurement, financial and accounting capabilities by offering targeted guidance in daily operations and comprehensive training for newly recruited staff.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifically, the role of the technical assistance should focus on accompanying the Secretariat in enhancing its capacity in drafting its operating budget taking into account OACPS MS contributions and different level of priorities in spending, as well as in managing its budget in a sound, sustainable and effective way. To this regard, the TA will work closely with the department of Administration, Finance and Human Resources, and will provide targeted guidance in daily operations and comprehensive training for newly recruited staff. Finally, the TA will support the Secretariat in reinforcing its financial and accounting reporting capacity.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
